1
00:00:00,832 --> 00:00:02,752
(Sheldon:)You sound surprised.

2
00:00:04,920 --> 00:00:06,210
(Sheldon:)Mmm.

3
00:00:06,922 --> 00:00:08,922
[SPEAKING IN MANDARIN]

4
00:00:24,439 --> 00:00:26,359
(Penny:)- Hi.
- Hi.

5
00:00:26,525 --> 00:00:29,275
- Come on in.
- Thank you.

6
